{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21923","headline":"哭孔戡 · 白居易","name":"哭孔戡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳谁不死，戡死闻长安。\n我是知戡者，闻之涕泫然。\n戡佐山东军，非义不可干。\n拂衣向西来，其道直如弦。\n从事得如此，人人以爲难。\n人言明明代，合置在朝端。\n或望居谏司，有事戡必言。\n或望居宪府，有邪戡必弹。\n惜哉两不谐，没齿爲闲官。\n竟不得一日，謇謇立君前。\n形骸随衆人，敛葬北邙山。\n平生刚肠内，直气归其间。\n贤者爲生民，生死悬在天。\n谓天不爱人，胡爲生其贤。\n谓天果爱民，胡爲夺其年。\n茫茫元化中，谁执如此权。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}